@k.words.frog.noun.1 k.words.sense word=frog pos=noun n=1 gloss="any of various tailless stout-bodied amphibians with long hind limbs for leaping; semiaquatic and terrestrial species" synonym=toad synonym="toad frog" synonym=anuran synonym=batrachian synonym=salientian is_a=amphibian core.source="wordnet 3.1"
